msgid "Toggles the use of the buttons to adjust the video filters"
msgstr "Preklop uporabe gumbov za ureditev video filtrov"

#: data/org.gnome.camorama.gschema.xml.in:126
msgid "Image width"
msgstr "Širina slike"

